Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20GWP=20facts(currentLocation)=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EB=B0=B0=EC=84=A0=20=E2=80=94=20callDeepSeek(kedu)=20=EC=84=9C?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EB=B2=84=EC=B8=A1=20=EA=B0=95=EC=A0=9C=20=EC=A3=BC=EC=9E=85?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EA=B3=BC=20=EC=97=B0=EA=B2=B0?=
